# RescueBite AI — Frontend Environment Variables (Optional)
# In Vite, client-exposed variables MUST be prefixed with VITE_

# API Base URL:
# For local dev, leave this blank or unset so Vite's proxy automatically routes '/api' to http://127.0.0.1:5000 without CORS issues.
# For production deployment (e.g. Vercel, Netlify), set this to your hosted backend URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-production-backend.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
